# Committed test-watershed fixture (05MH008). The repo-root .gitignore excludes
# geospatial formats (*.shp, *.dbf, ...) globally to keep working data out of
# git; this fixture is the deliberate exception, so re-include those formats
# for this directory only.
!*.shp
!*.shx
!*.dbf
!*.prj
!*.cpg
!*.geojson
